#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:8
msgid ""
"RPC calls use envelope `kind: \"req\"` with a unique `id`. Hub responds with "
"matching `kind: \"res\"`."
msgstr ""
"RPC 调用使用信封 `kind: \"req\"`，并携带唯一 `id`。Hub 以匹配的 `kind: "
"\"res\"` 响应。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:10
msgid ""
"The authoritative method list is `SAP_METHODS` in [`packages/sap-contract/"
"src/router.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/router.ts). Input/output Zod "
"schemas live under [`packages/sap-contract/src/frames/`](../../packages/sap-"
"contract/src/frames/)."
msgstr ""
"权威方法列表为 [`packages/sap-contract/src/router.ts`](../../packages/sap-"
"contract/src/router.ts) 中的 `SAP_METHODS`。输入/输出 Zod schema 位于 "
"[`packages/sap-contract/src/frames/`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/"
"frames/)。"

