#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:34
msgid "## Session"
msgstr "## 会话"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Method | Schema | Hub behavior |\n"
"| ------ | ------ | ------------ |\n"
"| `session.create` | [`session.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/frames/session.ts) | Creates session; sets `platform_extra.satellite_app_id`, `satellite_instance_id`, optional workspace fields |\n"
"| `session.list` | `session.ts` | Lists sessions, optional `platform` filter |\n"
"| `session.messages` | `session.ts` | Message history with `offset` / `limit` |\n"
"| `session.patchTitle` | `session.ts` | Updates session title |\n"
"| `session.subscribe` | `session.ts` | Subscribes to `session.updated` events for one session |\n"
"| `session.commands` | `session.ts` | Lists slash commands for a platform |\n"
"| `session.acpDock` | [`acp.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/frames/acp.ts) | ACP dock operations for a session |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Method | Schema | Hub behavior |\n"
"| ------ | ------ | ------------ |\n"
"| `session.create` | [`session.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/frames/session.ts) | 创建会话；设置 `platform_extra.satellite_app_id`、`satellite_instance_id`，以及可选的工作区字段 |\n"
"| `session.list` | `session.ts` | 列出会话，可选 `platform` 过滤 |\n"
"| `session.messages` | `session.ts` | 消息历史，支持 `offset` / `limit` |\n"
"| `session.patchTitle` | `session.ts` | 更新会话标题 |\n"
"| `session.subscribe` | `session.ts` | 订阅单个会话的 `session.updated` 事件 |\n"
"| `session.commands` | `session.ts` | 列出某平台的斜杠命令 |\n"
"| `session.acpDock` | [`acp.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/frames/acp.ts) | 会话的 ACP dock 操作 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:46
msgid "### `session.create` platform binding"
msgstr "### `session.create` 平台绑定"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:48
msgid ""
"Hub resolves `platform` from input or `resolvePlatformForApp(app_id)` (e.g. "
"`pair-programming` → `studio-pair-programming`). Writes into session "
"`platform_extra`:"
msgstr ""
"Hub 从输入或 `resolvePlatformForApp(app_id)` 解析 `platform`（例如 `pair-"
"programming` → `studio-pair-programming`）。写入会话的 `platform_extra`："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/methods.md:52
msgid "`satellite_app_id` — normalized app slug"
msgstr "`satellite_app_id` — 规范化后的 app slug"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/methods.md:52
msgid "`satellite_instance_id` — instance id from connect context"
msgstr "`satellite_instance_id` — 来自 connect 上下文的 instance id"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/methods.md:52
msgid ""
"Optional: `workspace_root`, `workspace_gitignore`, `workspace_show_hidden`, "
"`capability_mask`"
msgstr ""
"可选：`workspace_root`、`workspace_gitignore`、`workspace_show_hidden`、"
"`capability_mask`"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:54
msgid "This binding is required for [strict tool routing](tools.md)."
msgstr "此绑定是 [严格工具路由](tools.md) 所必需的。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:56
msgid "## Message"
msgstr "## 消息"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Method | Schema | Returns |\n"
"| ------ | ------ | ------- |\n"
"| `message.send` | [`message.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/frames/message.ts) | `{ stream_id }`; stream events follow on `evt` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Method | Schema | Returns |\n"
"| ------ | ------ | ------- |\n"
"| `message.send` | [`message.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/frames/message.ts) | `{ stream_id }`；后续流事件通过 `evt` 推送 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:62
msgid ""
"Payload: `session_id`, `message` (user text). Hub bridges runtime stream to "
"SAP `stream.*` events — see [events.md](events.md)."
msgstr ""
"载荷：`session_id`、`message`（用户文本）。Hub 将 runtime 流桥接到 SAP "
"`stream.*` 事件 — 见 [events.md](events.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:64
msgid "## Fridge"
msgstr "## Fridge"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:68
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Method | Schema | Role |\n"
"| ------ | ------ | ---- |\n"
"| `fridge.list` | [`fridge.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/frames/fridge.ts) | List fridge items for the runtime |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Method | Schema | Role |\n"
"| ------ | ------ | ---- |\n"
"| `fridge.list` | [`fridge.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/frames/fridge.ts) | 列出 runtime 的 Fridge 条目 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:70
msgid "## Terminal"
msgstr "## 终端"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:72
msgid ""
"Hub-side PTY sessions. Events: `terminal.ready`, `terminal.output`, "
"`terminal.exit`, `terminal.error`."
msgstr ""
"Hub 端 PTY 会话。事件：`terminal.ready`、`terminal.output`、`terminal.exit`、"
"`terminal.error`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:79
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Method | Schema |\n"
"| ------ | ------ |\n"
"| `terminal.attach` | [`terminal.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/frames/terminal.ts) — optional `cwd`; returns `terminal_id` |\n"
"| `terminal.write` | `terminal_id`, `data` |\n"
"| `terminal.resize` | `terminal_id`, `cols`, `rows` |\n"
"| `terminal.close` | `terminal_id` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Method | Schema |\n"
"| ------ | ------ |\n"
"| `terminal.attach` | [`terminal.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/frames/terminal.ts) — 可选 `cwd`；返回 `terminal_id` |\n"
"| `terminal.write` | `terminal_id`, `data` |\n"
"| `terminal.resize` | `terminal_id`, `cols`, `rows` |\n"
"| `terminal.close` | `terminal_id` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:81
msgid "## Tool (Satellite → Hub)"
msgstr "## 工具（Satellite → Hub）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Method | Direction | Role |\n"
"| ------ | --------- | ---- |\n"
"| `tool.register` | Satellite → Hub | Register local tools; returns canonical names |\n"
"| `tool.unregister` | Satellite → Hub | Remove tools by `local_names` |\n"
"| `tool.result` | Satellite → Hub | Complete a `tool.call` |\n"
"| `tool.error` | Satellite → Hub | Fail a `tool.call` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Method | Direction | Role |\n"
"| ------ | --------- | ---- |\n"
"| `tool.register` | Satellite → Hub | 注册本地工具；返回规范名称 |\n"
"| `tool.unregister` | Satellite → Hub | 按 `local_names` 移除工具 |\n"
"| `tool.result` | Satellite → Hub | 完成一次 `tool.call` |\n"
"| `tool.error` | Satellite → Hub | 使 `tool.call` 失败 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:90
msgid ""
"`tool.call` is an **event**, not RPC — see [tools.md](tools.md) and "
"[events.md](events.md)."
msgstr ""
"`tool.call` 是**事件**，不是 RPC — 见 [tools.md](tools.md) 与 [events.md]"
"(events.md)。"

